  "title": "Healthier Best Chocolate Chip Cookies",
  "description": "Chocolate chip cookies with crisp edges and chewy middles are given a healthy and fun twist by using sweet potato puree for some of the butter and orange juice as a replacement for sugar.",
  "authors": [
    "MakeItHealthy"
  ],
